#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0070 expect=noViolation domain=ADSL
#note "Synthesised-partner direction, the mirror of AD0066's skip. No TR01AG1N. TRxxAGy carries the full group set {xx, y}, so it SEEDS the tuple on its own; TR01AG1N is synthesised absent and the leading var_exists is false -> executes, silent. This is why the AD0066 case with no pooled column at all skips while this one does not: there the seeding patterns matched nothing, here one of them matched."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL structure=ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TR01AG1 type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | POOL1
